## The Drum Sing Dance program

{% columns layout="equal" align="center" %}
{% column card="none" %}
Rhythm Culture brings the energy, excitement and connection of West African drumming and dance to students across Australia. Our Drum Sing Dance program combines African drumming, singing and dancing in one action-packed, culturally rich incursion.

First, students warm up with coordination exercises on African drums. They explore call-and-response drumming patterns, then they work together to learn traditional rhythms which create a full musical ensemble.

We also tailor every workshop to the age, abilities and interests of your group. For example, little ones discover the beat for the first time, while senior students explore complex polyrhythms and ensemble playing.
{% /column %}

