## Corporate team building: the power of rhythm

Forget the usual team-building activities. Instead, everyone starts with a drum, and before long the group is creating rhythms together. As a result, participants discover how individual contributions combine into something much bigger.

Our workshops suit staff development days, including school staff PD, as well as conferences, celebrations and retreats. Drumming also lifts morale, relieves stress and puts everyone on equal footing. So bring your team, and we'll bring the drums!

