## Classes, camps & school drum sets

Beyond our African drumming incursions, Rhythm Culture also runs a thriving West African drum and dance community on the Sunshine Coast.

{% columns layout="equal" align="top" %}
{% column card="none" %}
![African drumming class](/media/2021/07/A08R0539-scaled.webp)

### Weekly African Drumming Classes

Open djembe classes for all levels run at Palmwoods Memorial Hall. Then, every ten weeks, students perform at our Drum, Dinner, Dance event.

